@startuml imaging-order-modeling

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 9
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  ArrowColor Black
}

package "Placer (EHR)" as placer [[https://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cow/2025May/core-concepts.html#actors]] {
  class "ServiceRequestPlacerOrderEuImaging\n<<ServiceRequest>>\nplacer order" as Order [[./StructureDefinition-ServiceRequestPlacerOrderEuImaging.html]] {
    +identifier[placerOrder] : PLAC
    +identifier[fillerOrder] : FILL
    +code : requested orderable
    +reason : reason / clinical question
    +requester
    +authoredOn
  }
}

package "Fulfiller (imaging department / RIS)" as filler [[https://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cow/2025May/core-concepts.html#actors]] {
  class "ServiceRequestFillerOrderEuImaging\n<<ServiceRequest>>\nfiller order" as ISR [[./StructureDefinition-ServiceRequestFillerOrderEuImaging.html]] {
    +identifier[accessionNumber] : ACSN (1..1)
    +identifier[fillerOrder] : FILL
    +code : requested procedure (protocolled)
    +basedOn : Reference(ServiceRequestPlacerOrderEuImaging)
  }

  class "ProcedureEuImaging\n<<Procedure>>\nperformed procedure" as Proc [[./StructureDefinition-ProcedureEuImaging.html]]

  class "ImagingStudyEuImaging\n<<ImagingStudy>>" as Study [[./StructureDefinition-ImagingStudyEuImaging.html]]

  class "DiagnosticReportEuImaging\n<<DiagnosticReport>>" as DR [[./StructureDefinition-DiagnosticReportEuImaging.html]]

  class "CompositionEuImaging\n<<Composition>>" as Comp [[./StructureDefinition-CompositionEuImaging.html]] {
    +section[order]
    +section[procedure]
  }

  class "Requested Procedure / Scheduled Procedure Step\n<<ServiceRequest / Task>>\n(DICOM MWL, not profiled here)" as MWL [[https://build.fhir.org/ig/HL7/imaging-service-request-ig/en/architecture.html#mwl-resource-reference-chain]] #EEEEEE
}

ISR "0..*" --> "0..*" Order : basedOn
Study --> ISR : basedOn (Accession Number)
DR --> ISR : basedOn (Accession Number)
Comp --> Order : section[order]
Comp --> ISR : section[order]
Comp --> Proc : section[procedure]
MWL ..> ISR : basedOn
Proc ..> ISR : fulfils

note right of ISR
  Aligned with ImagingServiceRequestProfile
  of the HL7 FHIR Imaging ServiceRequest IG
  [[https://build.fhir.org/ig/HL7/imaging-service-request-ig/en/StructureDefinition-imaging-service-request.html ImagingServiceRequestProfile]]
end note

note left of Order
  Placer Request in the
  Clinical Order Workflows IG
  [[https://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cow/2025May/core-concepts.html#requests-tasks-and-outputs-events Requests, Tasks and Outputs]]
end note

@enduml
